# Goal
# Command requesting an analysis. Currently the only supported value is
# "START_BLOODTEST".
string command
---
# Result
bool success
string message
# Cardiac marker concentrations measured by the analyser.
# Troponin T (cTnT) in ng/L.
float32 ctnt
# Troponin I (cTnI) in ng/L.
float32 ctni
# Creatine kinase MB (CK-MB) in %.
float32 ck_mb
---
# Feedback (streamed continuously during analysis)
# Carries only the live state and progress. The cardiac marker results
# (ctnt, ctni, ck_mb) are intentionally left empty here (result_valid = false)
# and are delivered exclusively in the Result above, so a streaming client is
# never shown stale values from a previous analysis.
hospital_interfaces/LabState telemetry

